{"id":"9e26cbd3fb377f03","group":"57","path":"57/57-cor-coincidence-sentence.md","title":"Sentence Satisfaction Independence","display":"cor-coincidence-sentence — Sentence Satisfaction Independence","type":"corollary","metadata":{"type":"corollary","book":"Mathematical Logic","book_abbrev":"57","label":"57-cor-coincidence-sentence","aliases":["57-cor-coincidence-sentence"],"display":"cor-coincidence-sentence — Sentence Satisfaction Independence","depends_on":["[[57-thm-coincidence-formula]]","[[57-df-sentence]]","[[57-df-free-variable]]","[[57-df-structure]]","[[57-df-assignment]]","[[57-df-satisfaction]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"corollary"},{"key":"book","html":"Mathematical Logic"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"57"},{"key":"label","html":"57-cor-coincidence-sentence"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>57-cor-coincidence-sentence</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"cor-coincidence-sentence — Sentence Satisfaction Independence"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"8216982d66b31a60\" href=\"?note=8216982d66b31a60\" title=\"57-thm-coincidence-formula\">57-thm-coincidence-formula</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"38cb16fd577caf7b\" href=\"?note=38cb16fd577caf7b\" title=\"57-df-sentence\">57-df-sentence</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"f2434afaa125d50e\" href=\"?note=f2434afaa125d50e\" title=\"57-df-free-variable\">57-df-free-variable</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"c136ba3960a7223a\" href=\"?note=c136ba3960a7223a\" title=\"57-df-structure\">57-df-structure</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"d5f7158a321b8947\" href=\"?note=d5f7158a321b8947\" title=\"57-df-assignment\">57-df-assignment</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-6\" data-note=\"03dc48eb29950767\" href=\"?note=03dc48eb29950767\" title=\"57-df-satisfaction\">57-df-satisfaction</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathfrak{A}\">\\(\\mathfrak{A}\\)</span> (<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"S\">\\(S\\)</span>-结构, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-7\" data-note=\"c136ba3960a7223a\" href=\"?note=c136ba3960a7223a\" title=\"57-df-structure\">57-df-structure</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\beta, \\gamma: \\mathrm{Var} \\to A\">\\(\\beta, \\gamma: \\mathrm{Var} \\to A\\)</span> (赋值, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-8\" data-note=\"d5f7158a321b8947\" href=\"?note=d5f7158a321b8947\" title=\"57-df-assignment\">57-df-assignment</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\varphi \\in \\mathrm{Sent}_S\">\\(\\varphi \\in \\mathrm{Sent}_S\\)</span> (句子, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-9\" data-note=\"38cb16fd577caf7b\" href=\"?note=38cb16fd577caf7b\" title=\"57-df-sentence\">57-df-sentence</a>)</li>\n</ul>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A=|\\mathfrak A|\">\\(A=|\\mathfrak A|\\)</span>；两个赋值的共同值域是这一载体。</p>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{cor\\text{-}coincidence\\text{-}sentence} \\vdash \\mathfrak{A} \\models \\varphi[\\beta] \\Leftrightarrow \\mathfrak{A} \\models \\varphi[\\gamma]\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{cor\\text{-}coincidence\\text{-}sentence} \\vdash \\mathfrak{A} \\models \\varphi[\\beta] \\Leftrightarrow \\mathfrak{A} \\models \\varphi[\\gamma]\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>For sentences (formulas with no free variables), satisfaction is <strong>independent</strong> of the choice of assignment. This allows us to write <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathfrak{A} \\models \\varphi\">\\(\\mathfrak{A} \\models \\varphi\\)</span> without specifying an assignment when <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\varphi\">\\(\\varphi\\)</span> is a sentence. The satisfaction relation <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\models\">\\(\\models\\)</span> is defined in <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-10\" data-note=\"03dc48eb29950767\" href=\"?note=03dc48eb29950767\" title=\"57-df-satisfaction\">57-df-satisfaction</a>.</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"57-thm-coincidence-formula","status":"resolved","id":"8216982d66b31a60","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[57-thm-coincidence-formula]]","embed":false},{"target":"57-df-sentence","status":"resolved","id":"38cb16fd577caf7b","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[57-df-sentence]]","embed":false},{"target":"57-df-free-variable","status":"resolved","id":"f2434afaa125d50e","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[57-df-free-variable]]","embed":false},{"target":"57-df-structure","status":"resolved","id":"c136ba3960a7223a","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[57-df-structure]]","embed":false},{"target":"57-df-assignment","status":"resolved","id":"d5f7158a321b8947","anchor":"ref-5","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[57-df-assignment]]","embed":false},{"target":"57-df-satisfaction","status":"resolved","id":"03dc48eb29950767","anchor":"ref-6","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[57-df-satisfaction]]","embed":false},{"target":"57-df-structure","status":"resolved","id":"c136ba3960a7223a","anchor":"ref-7","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathfrak{A}$ ($S$-结构, see [[57-df-structure]])","embed":false},{"target":"57-df-assignment","status":"resolved","id":"d5f7158a321b8947","anchor":"ref-8","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\beta, \\gamma: \\mathrm{Var} \\to A$ (赋值, see [[57-df-assignment]])","embed":false},{"target":"57-df-sentence","status":"resolved","id":"38cb16fd577caf7b","anchor":"ref-9","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\varphi \\in \\mathrm{Sent}_S$ (句子, see [[57-df-sentence]])","embed":false},{"target":"57-df-satisfaction","status":"resolved","id":"03dc48eb29950767","anchor":"ref-10","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Remark]","excerpt":"For sentences (formulas with no free variables), satisfaction is **independent** of the choice of assignment. This allows us to write $\\mathfrak{A} \\models \\varphi$ without specifying an assignment when $\\varphi$ is a sentence. The satisfaction relation $\\models$ is defined in [[57-df-satisfaction]].","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"\\mathfrak{A}","display":false},{"tex":"S","display":false},{"tex":"\\beta, \\gamma: \\mathrm{Var} \\to A","display":false},{"tex":"\\varphi \\in \\mathrm{Sent}_S","display":false},{"tex":"A=|\\mathfrak A|","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{cor\\text{-}coincidence\\text{-}sentence} \\vdash \\mathfrak{A} \\models \\varphi[\\beta] \\Leftrightarrow \\mathfrak{A} \\models \\varphi[\\gamma]","display":true},{"tex":"\\mathfrak{A} \\models \\varphi","display":false},{"tex":"\\varphi","display":false},{"tex":"\\models","display":false}],"bytes":1223,"backlinks":[{"id":"ca4dd8b012648fba","anchor":"ref-374","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[57-ax-equality-function-substitution]]\n[[57-ax-equality-predicate-substitution]]\n[[57-ax-equality-reflexivity]]\n[[57-ax-equality-term-substitution]]\n[[57-ax-generalization]]\n[[57-ax-hilbert-exists-introduction]]\n[[57-ax-hilbert-forall]]\n[[57-ax-hilbert-forall-instantiation]]\n[[57-ax-hilbert-impl1]]\n[[57-ax-hilbert-impl2]]\n[[57-ax-hilbert-neg]]\n[[57-ax-modus-ponens]]\n[[57-ax-substitution-schema]]\n[[57-cor-coincidence-sentence]]\n[[57-cor-ls-countable]]\n[[57-cor-ls-uncountable]]\n[[57-cor-substitution-simple]]"}],"outgoing":["8216982d66b31a60","38cb16fd577caf7b","f2434afaa125d50e","c136ba3960a7223a","d5f7158a321b8947","03dc48eb29950767"]}